### Wallet API Documentation
### Complete API documentation for wallet and transactions endpoints

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json
@token = your-jwt-token-here
@employeeToken = your-employee-jwt-token-here

### ============================================
### TOP-UP WALLET
### ============================================
### Create a top-up transaction for the authenticated user
### Requires user JWT token

POST {{baseUrl}}/wallet/top-up
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 100.50
}

### Request Body:
### - amount: Positive number with up to 2 decimal places (required)

### Response Example (201 Created):
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Top-up transaction created successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "id": "transaction-uuid",
###     "userId": "user-uuid",
###     "amount": 100.5,
###     "currency": "SAR",
###     "type": "TOP_UP",
###     "status": "PENDING",
###     "toWalletId": "wallet-uuid",
###     "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
###     "updatedAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
###   }
### }

### ============================================
### VERIFY TOP-UP TRANSACTION
### ============================================
### Verify a top-up transaction for the authenticated user
### Requires user JWT token

POST {{baseUrl}}/wallet/transactions/:id/verify
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "description": "Top-up completed successfully",
  "trace": "gateway-trace-id",
  "respondCode": "00",
  "respondMessage": "Approved",
  "respondStatus": "SUCCESS",
  "payResponseReturn": "raw-gateway-response",
  "token": "card-token-if-any",
  "paymentInfo": {
    "cardScheme": "VISA",
    "cardType": "CREDIT",
    "paymentDescription": "411111******1111",
    "expiryMonth": 12,
    "expiryYear": 2030
  }
}

### Path Parameters:
### - id: Transaction UUID (required)

### Request Body:
### - status: "COMPLETED" or "FAILED" (required)
### - description: Optional description (max 500 chars)
### - trace: Optional trace reference
### - respondCode: Optional gateway response code
### - respondMessage: Optional gateway response message
### - respondStatus: Optional gateway response status
### - payResponseReturn: Optional raw gateway response
### - token: Optional card token (required to save card)
### - paymentInfo: Optional object with card information

### Response Example (200 OK):
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Transaction verified successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "id": "transaction-uuid",
###     "status": "COMPLETED",
###     "amount": 100.5,
###     "currency": "SAR",
###     "type": "TOP_UP",
###     "toWalletId": "wallet-uuid",
###     "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
###     "updatedAt": "2024-01-01T00:05:00.000Z"
###   }
### }

### ============================================
### GET MY TRANSACTIONS
### ============================================
### Get all wallet transactions for the authenticated user
### Requires user JWT token

GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet/transactions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Response Example:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Transactions fetched successfully",
###   "data": [
###     {
###       "id": "transaction-uuid",
###       "userId": "user-uuid",
###       "amount": 100.5,
###       "currency": "SAR",
###       "type": "TOP_UP",
###       "status": "COMPLETED",
###       "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
###       "updatedAt": "2024-01-01T00:05:00.000Z"
###     }
###   ]
### }

