### ============================================
### START CONTRACT TRANSACTION (WALLET)
### ============================================
### Start a contract transaction using user wallet balance
### Requires user JWT token (client must own the contract)

POST {{baseUrl}}/wallet/contracts/:contractId/start-transaction
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 500.00
}

### Path Parameters:
### - contractId: Contract UUID (required)

### Request Body:
### - amount: Positive number with up to 2 decimal places (required)

### Response Example (200 OK):
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Transaction started successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "id": "transaction-uuid",
###     "userId": "client-user-uuid",
###     "amount": 500,
###     "currency": "SAR",
###     "type": "CONTRACT",
###     "status": "PENDING",
###     "fromWalletId": "client-wallet-uuid",
###     "toWalletId": "escrow-wallet-uuid",
###     "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
###     "updatedAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
###   }
### }

### ============================================
### VERIFY CONTRACT TRANSACTION (WALLET)
### ============================================
### Verify a contract transaction using wallet balance
### Requires user JWT token (must own the transaction)

POST {{baseUrl}}/wallet/transactions/:id/verify-contract
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Path Parameters:
### - id: Transaction UUID (required)

### Request Body:
### - No body required

### Response Example (200 OK):
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Transaction verified successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "id": "transaction-uuid",
###     "status": "COMPLETED",
###     "type": "CONTRACT",
###     "amount": 500,
###     "currency": "SAR",
###     "fromWalletId": "client-wallet-uuid",
###     "toWalletId": "escrow-wallet-uuid",
###     "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
###     "updatedAt": "2024-01-01T00:10:00.000Z"
###   }
### }

### ============================================
### VERIFY CONTRACT TRANSACTION (CARD)
### ============================================
### Verify a contract transaction using a payment card
### Requires user JWT token (must own the transaction)

POST {{baseUrl}}/wallet/transactions/:id/verify-contract-card
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "description": "Contract payment completed",
  "trace": "gateway-trace-id",
  "respondCode": "00",
  "respondMessage": "Approved",
  "respondStatus": "SUCCESS",
  "payResponseReturn": "raw-gateway-response",
  "token": "card-token",
  "paymentInfo": {
    "cardScheme": "VISA",
    "cardType": "CREDIT",
    "paymentDescription": "411111******1111",
    "expiryMonth": 12,
    "expiryYear": 2030
  }
}

### Path Parameters:
### - id: Transaction UUID (required)

### Request Body:
### - status: "COMPLETED" or "FAILED" (required)
### - description: Optional description
### - trace: Optional trace reference
### - respondCode: Optional gateway response code
### - respondMessage: Optional gateway response message
### - respondStatus: Optional gateway response status
### - payResponseReturn: Optional raw gateway response
### - token: Optional card token (required to save card)
### - paymentInfo: Optional object with card information

### Response Example (200 OK):
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Transaction verified successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "id": "transaction-uuid",
###     "status": "COMPLETED",
###     "type": "CONTRACT",
###     "amount": 500,
###     "currency": "SAR",
###     "toWalletId": "escrow-wallet-uuid",
###     "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
###     "updatedAt": "2024-01-01T00:10:00.000Z"
###   }
### }

### ============================================
### COMPREHENSIVE NOTES & GUIDELINES
### ============================================

### 1. AUTHENTICATION & AUTHORIZATION
###    - User endpoints (requires user JWT token):
###      * POST /api/wallet/top-up
###      * POST /api/wallet/transactions/:id/verify
###      * GET /api/wallet/transactions
###      * GET /api/wallet/cards
###      * POST /api/wallet/contracts/:contractId/start-transaction
###      * POST /api/wallet/transactions/:id/verify-contract
###      * POST /api/wallet/transactions/:id/verify-contract-card
###    - Employee-only endpoints (requires employee JWT token):
###      * GET /api/wallet/transactions/all

### 2. TRANSACTION TYPES
###    - TOP_UP: User adds funds to their wallet
###    - CONTRACT: Funds moved from user wallet to escrow for a contract

### 3. STATUSES
###    - PENDING: Transaction created, waiting for verification
###    - COMPLETED: Transaction verified and applied
###    - FAILED: Transaction failed and not applied

### 4. CURRENCY
###    - All amounts are in SAR (Saudi Riyal)

### 5. ERROR RESPONSES
###    - 400 Bad Request: Validation errors (amount not positive, invalid status, etc.)
###    - 401 Unauthorized: Missing or invalid authentication token
###    - 403 Forbidden: User not authorized for the action (not contract owner, etc.)
###    - 404 Not Found: Transaction, wallet, contract, or escrow not found
###    - 500 Internal Server Error: Server error

### 6. BEST PRACTICES
###    - Always verify top-up transactions after payment gateway callback
###    - Use contract transactions for escrow-based payments
###    - Save card tokens securely and reuse them for future payments

